Z||000003||btoth||03-17-2001||09:59 AM||||Yeah, Netscape 6 is awfull.  Actually, I like IE better than Netscape (Communicator) for most features but I always liked the little email checker that comes with Netscape.  And I like Netscape Messenger just a tad bit better than Outlook.  The dumb thing is that when I started using Outlook Express I just imported all my messages and address book from Netscape directly, it was very easy to do.  But I guess Outlook Express can only export to Outlook... how dumb is that?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  What they need is a good browser package like Netscape Comunicator but with the best features of both.  (Like that will ever happen.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)||||reg||7
